  "limits": [
    "Finite Linux local peer checks, without resource-table instrumentation. Peers verify query bytes and connection termination, not general leak freedom.",
    "Buffered-abort case installs a deterministic test-only unread suffix on a real connection; it does not rely on OS read coalescing.",
    "Connection takes ownership of an already adopted abortable socket; numeric connection establishment is composed in the fixture using the isolated owned-connection primitive.",
